wb0: $ G , w ∊ suc a , w ∊ a ⇒ w ∊ ω ∨ ¬ w ∊ ω $ by excluded_middle
wb1: $ G , w ∊ suc a , w ∊ a , w ∊ ω ⇒ w ∊ ω $ by ax
wb2: $ G , w ∊ suc a , w ∊ a , w ∊ ω ⇒ {y | (w ∊ ω ∧ y ∊ suc w) ∨ (¬ w ∊ ω ∧ ¬ w = a ∧ y ∊ w)} = suc w $ by c1_v1 [wb1]
wb3: $ G , w ∊ suc a , w ∊ a , w ∊ ω ⇒ suc w ∈ ω $ by omega_suc [wb1]
