wc1: $ G , w ∊ suc a , w ∊ a , ¬ w ∊ ω ⇒ ¬ w ∊ ω $ by ax
wc2: $ G , w ∊ suc a , w ∊ a , ¬ w ∊ ω , w = a ⇒ w = a $ by ax
wc3: $ G , w ∊ suc a , w ∊ a , ¬ w ∊ ω , w = a ⇒ w ∊ a $ by ax
wc4: $ G , w ∊ suc a , w ∊ a , ¬ w ∊ ω , w = a ⇒ a ∊ a $ by welc_eq_set [wc2, wc3]
wc5: $ G , w ∊ suc a , w ∊ a , ¬ w ∊ ω , w = a ⇒ ⊥ $ by notin_self [wc4]
wc6: $ G , w ∊ suc a , w ∊ a , ¬ w ∊ ω ⇒ ¬ w = a $ by not_intro [wc5]
wc7: $ G , w ∊ suc a , w ∊ a , ¬ w ∊ ω ⇒ {y | (w ∊ ω ∧ y ∊ suc w) ∨ (¬ w ∊ ω ∧ ¬ w = a ∧ y ∊ w)} = w $ by c1_v2 [wc1, wc6]
wc8: $ G , w ∊ suc a , w ∊ a , ¬ w ∊ ω ⇒ w ∊ a $ by ax
